# UI soul (required)

Noche Live is a **white, tactile** product. A view without spacing or motion is unfinished.

- Canvas: warm white (`--paper`). Ink text. Gold is the only loud accent. No dark navy pages.
- Space: 8px scale (`--space-1`…`--space-8`). Cards ≥ `--space-6` padding. Stacks use **gap**, not random margins.
- Type: Fraunces for display, Figtree for UI. Touch targets ≥ 44px; player slam controls are much larger.
- Player screens are **picture-first**: a child who cannot read should still know what to tap. Keep Spanish captions.
- Motion: every pressable control gets press scale + ripple (`press` controller). Screen and Turbo Stream swaps use View Transitions (`motion` controller).
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Do not add a CSS framework, a new palette, or dark mode.
- When touching `app/views`, `app/assets/stylesheets`, or Stimulus UI, follow `.cursor/skills/noche-ui/SKILL.md`.
